# openmp — lift-source

Upstream: https://github.com/conda-forge/openmp-feedstock
Fork:     https://github.com/NAGAGroup/openmp-feedstock
Pinned:   58b3a7f27e55f7751712fabdd762f0874e2e58f6 (conda-forge main, 2026-08-26)

LIFT, NOT SUBMODULE: we do not build this feedstock. Its content is copied
into our own core recipe, because acpp forces LLVM+clang into ONE cmake
configure and conda-forge's per-component split cannot carry it.

LLVM's OpenMP runtime. WHAT WE LIFT: build flags. Relevant to acpp's OMP
backend and to the accelerated-CPU path.

TO DIFF AGAINST UPSTREAM:
    git clone https://github.com/NAGAGroup/openmp-feedstock
    git -C openmp-feedstock diff 58b3a7f27e55f7751712fabdd762f0874e2e58f6..origin/main
